    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but some people say those rules actually just favor big countries and hurt smaller ones or even local industries inside a country. can u give me a quick list of the main criticisms or downsides to that kind of global trade setup?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
